 "notes": [
  "The front elevation mirrors the Spanish concept image: a left-hand entrance veranda with carved wooden double doors, a central drawing room with twin arched windows, and a 2-car porch on the right.",
  "Upstairs, the master suite sits on the front-left behind a full-width veranda with three arched openings under a terracotta hip roof, while the front-right bedroom features twin arched windows and the stair tower rises on the right.",
  "All 5 bedrooms have attached bathrooms touching exterior walls or open terraces for direct natural ventilation, and bathrooms are stacked cleanly on the rear and east walls.",
  "The dog-leg stair hall (8.5 x 14.5 ft) provides a generous 3.5 ft landing strip at the front edge on both levels, connecting directly to the family lounges and opening onto the roof terrace.",
  "A concrete water tank sits beside the right-side mumty tower, leaving the western roof slab completely unshaded for the solar panel array."
 ],
